{
  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": "ah Iohannes swa upp to \u00feam bisceope, \u00fee \u00f0a niwan w\u00e6s gehadod, & him \u00feus to cw\u00e6\u00f0: Wite Hw\u00e6t, \u00fea se bisceop bli\u00f0elice underfeng \u00feone fores\u00e6dan cniht, & s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde his gimene Iohannes \u00fea eft geedleahte his word & gelome bebead \u00feam bisceope mid h\u00e6sum, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feone iungan Se bisceop \u00fea underfeng, swa swa him beboden w\u00e6s, \u00feone iungan cniht, & him Cristes lare He geseah \u00fea sona \u00fe\u00e6t he his sylfes geweold on ungeripedum freodome & unsta\u00f0\u00f0igum \u00feeawum, & He & his geferan \u00fea begunnon to lufienne \u00fea micclan druncennisse on nihtlicum gedwylde, & hig \u00fea He genam \u00fea heardlice \u00feurh heora lare on his or\u00feance \u00fea egeslican d\u00e6da, & swa swa modig hors \u00fee Him \u00feuhte \u00fea to waclic \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde gefremman \u00fea l\u00e6ssan leahtras, ac he leornode \u00e6fre maran & He ne ge\u00feafode \u00fea, \u00fe\u00e6t he under\u00feeod w\u00e6re yfelum gegadum, \u00fee hine \u00e6r forl\u00e6rdon, ac wolde beon Eft \u00fea \u00e6fter fyrste ferde se apostol to \u00fe\u00e6re fores\u00e6dan byrig, \u00f0e se bisceop on wunode, \u00fee \u00feone cniht He cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea anr\u00e6dlice: Eala \u00feu la bisceop, gebring me nu \u00e6tforan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00f0e bef\u00e6ste on mines He wear\u00f0 \u00fea ablicged & wende \u00fe\u00e6t he b\u00e6de sumes o\u00feres sceattes o\u00f0\u00f0e sumes feos, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he ne",
